35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The monitor readings are shocking. One room uses four times more than another.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,The template trial was a nightmare. Keying in every invoice took hours.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The payment log shows three late payments. People are anxious about the amounts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The electrician quote is 34,000 yen per room. That’s a huge upfront cost.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The winter habits show people just leave heaters on. It’s not about control, it’s about comfort.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, 34,000 yen is steep. Is it worth it for the accuracy?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, if the template is this hard, manual metering will be worse.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, the late payments suggest people don’t trust the current system.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, I’m hesitant. The upfront cost is high, but the winter bills are too.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,I think the cooler notice shows people are already avoiding shared costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The usage gap is too big to ignore. We need a way to account for it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,I don’t want to be the one logging readings for forty minutes every month.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The settling up process took three weeks last time. We need something simpler.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I need to see if the seasonal fixed rate covers the winter spike.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,I’m worried that any new system will just create new arguments.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let’s look at the options. I think per-room metering is the only fair way.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,I’m leaning towards a seasonal fixed rate. It’s less work for everyone.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Mio. A fixed rate reduces the monthly friction.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I’m still on the fence. The upfront cost of metering is a barrier.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I just want us to get along. Whatever we choose, let’s stick to it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
